    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 11 August 2025, the proposed use of a room at 39 Harvard Road TW7 4PA as an office to take minicab bookings as shown on the drawings submitted on 11/08/2025 and numbered: 2K25-03, S-1, Unnumbered Location Plan 1 was lawful within the meaning of Section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 because: \r\nThe proposed use would be ancillary to the use of the house for residential purposes and therefore there would be no material change of use of the property as defined by Section 55 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).\r\n"
